        "abstract": "The preliminary version of a technical standard was issued by the end of 1993. This presentation introduces technical content which has been decided, including the methods of video recording, handling of signalling bits, interface ID, compatibility with 4:3 picture recording, and an outline of the future perspective.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
