        ],
        "abstract": "Within five years PALplus has gone from concept to market introduction with transmissions already taking place in Germany with the introduction of receivers by the end of 1994, achieved by a consortium where each member bears his own costs and has a clear strategy to bring a high performance wide-screen compatible PAL system to the market with a commitment to provide an attractive product and programmes for a consumer who, in the end, would finally decide the success of the project. This review covers the performance criteria, letterbox reproduction on conventional screens, the time-scales for the project and its current status.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
